		</special_quality>
			<name>Elven Magic</name>
			<description>Elves receive a +2 racial bonus on caster level checks made to overcome spell resistance. In addition, elves receive a +2 racial bonus on Spellcraft skill checks made to identify the properties of magic items.</description>
			<type>RACIALTRAITS.ELF RACIAL TRAIT.ELF RACIAL DEFAULT.SPECIALQUALITY.SPECIAL QUALITY.ELVEN MAGIC</type>
